<figure class="mw-halign-none noresize noviewer" typeof="mw:File/Thumb"><a href="/wiki/%D0%A4%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BB:%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D1%82_%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D1%82_%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.jpg/3000px-%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D1%82_%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.jpg" decoding="async" width="3000" height="254" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D1%82_%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.jpg/4500px-%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D1%82_%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.jpg 1.5x, //upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D1%82_%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.jpg/6000px-%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8F_%D0%B8_%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D1%82_%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.jpg 2x" data-file-width="10215" data-file-height="864" /></a><figcaption><div class="ts-panorama-desc"><div>Д. С. Индейцев. Панорама Кремля и <a href="/wiki/%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%8C%D0%B5_(%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BE%D0%BD)" title="Замоскворечье (исторический район)">Замоскворечья</a> от <a href="/wiki/%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D1%8F" title="Тайницкая башня">Тайницкой башни</a>. 1848 год</div></div></figcaption></figure>
</div>
